ue</th></tr><tr><td>Island</td><td><a href=\"wiki://allod/ingos\">Ingos</a></td></tr></table><h2>Connected locations</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Maps</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz22k\">Mining district</a></td></tr></table><h2>Inhabitants</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Related page</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/vor\">Crooked</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/gerald\">Geraldine</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/mthief\">Trickster</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/kmage\">Yam-Akara</a></td></tr></table><h2>Creatures and people</h2><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Related page</th><th>Details</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz22k%20human%20woodcuter%20m\">Creature (variant 118)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz22k%20human%20fireman%20f\">Creature (variant 119)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz22k%20human%20talker1%20m\">Creature (variant 120)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz22k%20human%20talker2%20m\">Creature (variant 121)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz22k%20human%20talker3%20m\">Creature (variant 122)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz22k%20human%20talker4%20m\">Creature (variant 123)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz22k%20human%20talker1%20f\">Creature (variant 124)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz22k%20human%20talker2%20f\">Creature (variant 125)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz22k%20human%20talker3%20f\">Creature (variant 126)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz22k%20human%20talker4%20f\">Creature (variant 127)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz22k%20human%20leader%20f\">Creature (variant 128)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz22k%20human%20thief%20m\">Creature (variant 129)</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/bz22k